1. space-between
Sirf items ke beech space hota hai.
Edges par space = 0

2. space-around
Har item ke around equal space hota hai.
Edge ka space items ke beech ke space ka half hota hai.

3.space-evenly
Yahan every gap exactly equal hota hai Including edges.

justified content :- 
1.justify-content :- Controls how items are positioned along the main axis.
Items move left ↔ right:

Align items:-
1.align-items:-Controls how items are positioned along the cross axis.
For a row, that means up ↕ down

